4\\u0648\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0643\\u0645\\u0628\\u064a\\u0648\\u062a\\u0631.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\"},{\"id\":361,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":178,\"locale\":\"en\",\"value\":\"Evolved into the Bukhara Engineering-Technological Institute (BETI), establishing major departments in oil & gas refining, automation, and computer science.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:02.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:02.000000Z\"},{\"id\":545,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":178,\"locale\":\"ru\",\"value\":\"\\u042d\\u0432\\u043e\\u043b\\u044e\\u0446\\u0438\\u044f \\u0432 \\u0411\\u0443\\u0445\\u0430\\u0440\\u0441\\u043a\\u0438\\u0439 \\u0438\\u043d\\u0436\\u0435\\u043d\\u0435\\u0440\\u043d\\u043e-\\u0442\\u0435\\u0445\\u043d\\u043e\\u043b\\u043e\\u0433\\u0438\\u0447\\u0435\\u0441\\u043a\\u0438\\u0439 \\u0438\\u043d\\u0441\\u0442\\u0438\\u0442\\u0443\\u0442 (\\u0411\\u0418\\u0422\\u0418), \\u0441\\u043e\\u0437\\u0434\\u0430\\u043d\\u0438\\u0435 \\u043a\\u0440\\u0443\\u043f\\u043d\\u044b\\u0445 \\u043a\\u0430\\u0444\\u0435\\u0434\\u0440 \\u0430\\u0432\\u0442\\u043e\\u043c\\u0430\\u0442\\u0438\\u0437\\u0430\\u0446\\u0438\\u0438 \\u0438 \\u043d\\u0435\\u0444\\u0442\\u0435\\u0433\\u0430\\u0437\\u043e\\u0432\\u043e\\u0433\\u043e \\u0434\\u0435\\u043b\\u0430.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:03.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:03.000000Z\"},{\"id\":729,\"about_page_content_entry_id\":178,\"locale\":\"uz\",\"value\":\"Buxoro muhandislik-texnologiya instituti (BMTI) sifatida qayta tashkil etilib, neft-gaz va kompyuter fanlari kafedralari tashkil etilishi.\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:04.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:04.000000Z\"}]},{\"id\":179,\"about_page_id\":1,\"path\":\"timeline.items.3.year\",\"value_type\":\"text\",\"sort_order\":178,\"is_active\":true,\"created_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-07-22T21:45:01.000000Z\",\"translations\"