(8, 2, 'ar', 'العمارة', 'العمارة', 'The Department of Architecture was founded following the presidential instructions of 2008 to preserve and develop Bukhara\'s unique historical architectural heritage. We train architects who design modern, smart buildings that blend with Bukhara\'s historic aesthetics. Our research focuses on building aerodynamics, climate-adapted structures, and restoration methodologies of ancient brick structures.', NULL, 'العمارة Dept', 'The Department of Architecture was founded following the presidential instructions of 2008 to preserve and develop Bukhara\'s unique historical architectural heritage. We train architects who design mo', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
(9, 3, 'en', 'Civil Engineering', 'Civil Engineering', 'The Department of Civil Engineering provides comprehensive training in structural mechanics, soil mechanics, concrete technologies, and project management. We prepare graduates to lead civil engineering infrastructure developments, high-rise buildings, and underground structures. Our research specializes in seismic-resistant structural engineering, concrete longevity, and geotechnical behaviors of desert soils.', NULL, 'Civil Engineering Dept', 'The Department of Civil Engineering provides comprehensive training in structural mechanics, soil mechanics, concrete technologies, and project management. We prepare graduates to lead civil engineeri', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
(10, 3, 'uz', 'Department of Civil Engineering', 'Civil Engineering', 'The Department of Civil Engineering provides comprehensive training in structural mechanics, soil mechanics, concrete technologies, and project management. We prepare graduates to lead civil engineering infrastructure developments, high-rise buildings, and underground structures. Our research specializes in seismic-resistant structural engineering, concrete longevity, and geotechnical behaviors of desert soils.', NULL, 'Department of Civil Engineering Dept', 'The Department of Civil Engineering provides comprehensive training in structural mechanics, soil mechanics, concrete technologies, and project management. We prepare graduates to lead civil engineeri', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
(11, 3, 'ru', 'Строительная инженерия', 'Строительная инженерия', 'The Department of Civil Engineering provides comprehensive training in structural mechanics, soil mechanics, concrete technologies, and project management. We prepare graduates to lead civil engineering infrastructure developments, high-rise buildings, and underground structures. Our research specializes in seismic-resistant structural engineering, concrete longevity, and geotechnical behaviors of desert soils.', NULL, 'Строительная инженерия Dept', 'The Department of Civil Engineering provides comprehensive training in structural mechanics, soil mechanics, concrete technologies, and project management. We prepare graduates to lead civil engineeri', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
(12, 3, 'ar', 'الهندسة المدنية', 'الهندسة المدنية', 'The Department of Civil Engineering provides comprehensive training in structural mechanics, soil mechanics, concrete technologies, and project management. We prepare graduates to lead civil engineering infrastructure developments, high-rise buildings, and underground structures. Our research specializes in seismic-resistant structural engineering, concrete longevity, and geotechnical behaviors of desert soils.', NULL, 'الهندسة المدنية Dept', 'The Department of Civil Engineering provides comprehensive training in structural mechanics, soil mechanics, concrete technologies, and project management. We prepare graduates to lead civil engineeri', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
(13, 4, 'en', 'Light Industry Engineering and Design', 'Light Industry Engineering and Design', 'The Department of Light Industry Engineering and Design focuses on textile processing, garment technology, apparel manufacturing, and fashion design. We combine advanced machinery operations with creative design parameters to prepare specialists for Uzbekistan\'s booming cotton and light industry manufacturing sectors. Our graduates lead textile conglomerates, design studios, and logistics networks.', NULL, 'Light Industry Engineering and Design Dept', 'The Department of Light Industry Engineering and Design focuses on textile processing, garment technology, apparel manufacturing, and fashion design. We combine advanced machinery operations with crea', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
