(16, 4, 'ar', 'هندسة وتصميم الصناعات الخفيفة', 'هندسة وتصميم الصناعات الخفيفة', 'The Department of Light Industry Engineering and Design focuses on textile processing, garment technology, apparel manufacturing, and fashion design. We combine advanced machinery operations with creative design parameters to prepare specialists for Uzbekistan\'s booming cotton and light industry manufacturing sectors. Our graduates lead textile conglomerates, design studios, and logistics networks.', NULL, 'هندسة وتصميم الصناعات الخفيفة Dept', 'The Department of Light Industry Engineering and Design focuses on textile processing, garment technology, apparel manufacturing, and fashion design. We combine advanced machinery operations with crea', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
(17, 5, 'en', 'Mechanics and Engineering Graphics', 'Mechanics and Engineering Graphics', 'The Department of Mechanics and Engineering Graphics teaches the fundamental science of engineering: statics, dynamics, kinematics, materials strength, and computer drafting. We serve as a core technical department for the entire university, offering foundational courses in drawing, CAD modeling, and mechanical assembly simulations to prepare students for core industrial design.', NULL, 'Mechanics and Engineering Graphics Dept', 'The Department of Mechanics and Engineering Graphics teaches the fundamental science of engineering: statics, dynamics, kinematics, materials strength, and computer drafting. We serve as a core techni', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
