(24, 6, 'ar', 'الآلات والمعدات التكنولوجية', 'الآلات والمعدات التكنولوجية', 'The Department of Technological Machines and Equipment trains mechanical engineers specializing in the design, installation, and maintenance of machinery used in light industry, cotton processing, food manufacturing, and chemical plants. We focus on machinery thermodynamics, vibration analysis, automated maintenance schedules, and machine durability.', NULL, 'الآلات والمعدات التكنولوجية Dept', 'The Department of Technological Machines and Equipment trains mechanical engineers specializing in the design, installation, and maintenance of machinery used in light industry, cotton processing, foo', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
(25, 7, 'en', 'Textile Materials Science', 'Textile Materials Science', 'The Department of Textile Materials Science focuses on the structures, physics, and chemistry of natural and synthetic fibers, yarns, and fabrics. Given Bukhara\'s position in cotton growing and processing, our research aims to optimize cotton fiber processing, analyze fabric strength, develop ecological dyes, and study smart textile integrations.', NULL, 'Textile Materials Science Dept', 'The Department of Textile Materials Science focuses on the structures, physics, and chemistry of natural and synthetic fibers, yarns, and fabrics. Given Bukhara\'s position in cotton growing and proces', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
