(85, 22, 'en', 'Economics and Management', 'Economics and Management', 'The Department of Economics and Management focuses on industrial economics, digital business models, finance, marketing audits, and strategic project management. We combine financial theories with data analytics to prepare managers who lead digital business transformations.', NULL, 'Economics and Management Dept', 'The Department of Economics and Management focuses on industrial economics, digital business models, finance, marketing audits, and strategic project management. We combine financial theories with dat', '2026-07-16 00:25:35', '2026-07-16 00:25:35'),
