(9, 3, 'en', 'Power Engineering', 'Electrical power systems, electric grids, renewable energy, and power station operations.', 'Successful completion of secondary education\nHigh scores in national Physics and Mathematics entrance exams\nAptitude for electro-technical subjects', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Electrical Circuits & Fields\nPower Generation Systems\nTransmission and Distribution Networks\nRenewable Energy Technology\nPower Electronics & Control\nSmart Grid Management', 'Power Grid Engineer\nElectrical Systems Designer\nRenewable Energy Consultant\nSubstation Operations Manager\nEnergy Auditor', 'Power Engineering Bachelor', 'Power Engineering covers electricity generation, transmission, distribution, and consumption. The curriculum focuses on electric grids, high-voltage technology, power electronics, and renewable energy', '2026-07-16 00:25:36', '2026-07-16 00:25:36'),
