(13, 4, 'en', 'Mechanical Engineering', 'Mechanical design, thermodynamics, manufacturing technologies, robotics, and machine parts.', 'Secondary school diploma\nHigh scores in Mathematics and Physics exams\nSpatial thinking capabilities', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Engineering Mechanics\nThermodynamics and Fluids\nComputer-Aided Engineering\nRobotics & Automation\nMachine Dynamics\nMaterials Science', 'Mechanical Design Engineer\nRobotics Engineer\nManufacturing Analyst\nAutomated Systems Specialist\nMaintenance Engineer', 'Mechanical Engineering Bachelor', 'The Mechanical Engineering program at BSTU provides a comprehensive background in machine design, thermodynamics, fluid mechanics, robotics, and automated manufacturing systems. Students study compute', '2026-07-16 00:25:36', '2026-07-16 00:25:36'),
(14, 4, 'uz', 'Mechanical Engineering', 'Mechanical design, thermodynamics, manufacturing technologies, robotics, and machine parts.', 'Secondary school diploma\nHigh scores in Mathematics and Physics exams\nSpatial thinking capabilities', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Engineering Mechanics\nThermodynamics and Fluids\nComputer-Aided Engineering\nRobotics & Automation\nMachine Dynamics\nMaterials Science', 'Mechanical Design Engineer\nRobotics Engineer\nManufacturing Analyst\nAutomated Systems Specialist\nMaintenance Engineer', 'Mechanical Engineering Bachelor', 'The Mechanical Engineering program at BSTU provides a comprehensive background in machine design, thermodynamics, fluid mechanics, robotics, and automated manufacturing systems. Students study compute', '2026-07-16 00:25:36', '2026-07-16 00:25:36'),
