(227, 57, 'ru', 'Химическая технология, процессы и аппараты пищевой промышленности', 'Химическая технология, процессы и аппараты пищевой промышленности реализуется на факультете технологий с кафедральной теоретической и практической подготовкой.', 'Admission is conducted under the applicable national higher education rules.\nApplicants should meet the entrance requirements for the selected technology field.\nLaboratory safety and practical training readiness are required after enrollment.', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Doctoral research\nFood industry processes\nChemical technology devices\nScientific publication\nDissertation work\nScientific seminars', 'Researcher\nUniversity teacher\nFood process researcher\nScientific council applicant', 'Химическая технология, процессы и аппараты пищевой промышленности PhD', 'Химическая технология, процессы и аппараты пищевой промышленности реализуется на факультете технологий с кафедральной теоретической и практической подготовкой.', '2026-07-16 00:25:39', '2026-07-16 00:25:39'),
(228, 57, 'ar', 'التكنولوجيا الكيميائية وعمليات وأجهزة صناعة الأغذية', 'يُقدَّم برنامج التكنولوجيا الكيميائية وعمليات وأجهزة صناعة الأغذية في كلية التكنولوجيا مع تدريب أكاديمي وعملي تابع للقسم.', 'Admission is conducted under the applicable national higher education rules.\nApplicants should meet the entrance requirements for the selected technology field.\nLaboratory safety and practical training readiness are required after enrollment.', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Doctoral research\nFood industry processes\nChemical technology devices\nScientific publication\nDissertation work\nScientific seminars', 'Researcher\nUniversity teacher\nFood process researcher\nScientific council applicant', 'التكنولوجيا الكيميائية وعمليات وأجهزة صناعة الأغذية PhD', 'يُقدَّم برنامج التكنولوجيا الكيميائية وعمليات وأجهزة صناعة الأغذية في كلية التكنولوجيا مع تدريب أكاديمي وعملي تابع للقسم.', '2026-07-16 00:25:39', '2026-07-16 00:25:39'),
(229, 58, 'en', 'Technologies and Biotechnologies for Processing, Storage and Processing of Agricultural and Food Products', 'Technologies and Biotechnologies for Processing, Storage and Processing of Agricultural and Food Products is offered by the Faculty of Technology with department-based academic and practical training.', 'Admission is conducted under the applicable national higher education rules.\nApplicants should meet the entrance requirements for the selected technology field.\nLaboratory safety and practical training readiness are required after enrollment.', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Doctoral research\nAgricultural product technologies\nFood product biotechnology\nScientific publication\nDissertation work\nScientific seminars', 'Researcher\nUniversity teacher\nFood biotechnology researcher\nScientific council applicant', 'Technologies and Biotechnologies for Processing, Storage and Processing of Agricultural and Food Products PhD', 'Technologies and Biotechnologies for Processing, Storage and Processing of Agricultural and Food Products is offered by the Faculty of Technology with department-based academic and practical training.', '2026-07-16 00:25:39', '2026-07-16 00:25:39'),
(230, 58, 'uz', 'Qishloq xo\'jaligi va oziq-ovqat mahsulotlarini qayta ishlash, saqlash texnologiyalari va biotexnologiyalari', 'Qishloq xo\'jaligi va oziq-ovqat mahsulotlarini qayta ishlash, saqlash texnologiyalari va biotexnologiyalari Texnologiya fakultetida kafedra yo\'nalishidagi nazariy va amaliy tayyorgarlik asosida o\'qitiladi.', 'Admission is conducted under the applicable national higher education rules.\nApplicants should meet the entrance requirements for the selected technology field.\nLaboratory safety and practical training readiness are required after enrollment.', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Doctoral research\nAgricultural product technologies\nFood product biotechnology\nScientific publication\nDissertation work\nScientific seminars', 'Researcher\nUniversity teacher\nFood biotechnology researcher\nScientific council applicant', 'Qishloq xo\'jaligi va oziq-ovqat mahsulotlarini qayta ishlash, saqlash texnologiyalari va biotexnologiyalari PhD', 'Qishloq xo\'jaligi va oziq-ovqat mahsulotlarini qayta ishlash, saqlash texnologiyalari va biotexnologiyalari Texnologiya fakultetida kafedra yo\'nalishidagi nazariy va amaliy tayyorgarlik asosida o\'qiti', '2026-07-16 00:25:39', '2026-07-16 00:25:39'),
(231, 58, 'ru', 'Технологии и биотехнологии переработки, хранения и обработки сельскохозяйственных и пищевых продуктов', 'Технологии и биотехнологии переработки, хранения и обработки сельскохозяйственных и пищевых продуктов реализуется на факультете технологий с кафедральной теоретической и практической подготовкой.', 'Admission is conducted under the applicable national higher education rules.\nApplicants should meet the entrance requirements for the selected technology field.\nLaboratory safety and practical training readiness are required after enrollment.', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Doctoral research\nAgricultural product technologies\nFood product biotechnology\nScientific publication\nDissertation work\nScientific seminars', 'Researcher\nUniversity teacher\nFood biotechnology researcher\nScientific council applicant', 'Технологии и биотехнологии переработки, хранения и обработки сельскохозяйственных и пищевых продуктов PhD', 'Технологии и биотехнологии переработки, хранения и обработки сельскохозяйственных и пищевых продуктов реализуется на факультете технологий с кафедральной теоретической и практической подготовкой.', '2026-07-16 00:25:39', '2026-07-16 00:25:39'),
(232, 58, 'ar', 'تقنيات وتقانات حيوية لمعالجة وتخزين المنتجات الزراعية والغذائية', 'يُقدَّم برنامج تقنيات وتقانات حيوية لمعالجة وتخزين المنتجات الزراعية والغذائية في كلية التكنولوجيا مع تدريب أكاديمي وعملي تابع للقسم.', 'Admission is conducted under the applicable national higher education rules.\nApplicants should meet the entrance requirements for the selected technology field.\nLaboratory safety and practical training readiness are required after enrollment.', 'Passport, High school certificate.', 'Doctoral research\nAgricultural product technologies\nFood product biotechnology\nScientific publication\nDissertation work\nScientific seminars', 'Researcher\nUniversity teacher\nFood biotechnology researcher\nScientific council applicant', 'تقنيات وتقانات حيوية لمعالجة وتخزين المنتجات الزراعية والغذائية PhD', 'يُقدَّم برنامج تقنيات وتقانات حيوية لمعالجة وتخزين المنتجات الزراعية والغذائية في كلية التكنولوجيا مع تدريب أكاديمي وعملي تابع للقسم.', '2026-07-16 00:25:39', '2026-07-16 00:25:39');
