(1, 1, 'en', 'Video Gallery', 'Life at BSTU in Videos', 'Watch special reports and highlights of our university life, achievements, and events.', 'Video Gallery', 'Recommended Videos', 'Videos', 'Video Description & Highlights', 'Show more', 'Show less', 'Like', 'Liked', 'Share', 'Subscribe', 'Subscribed', 'subscribers', 'Link copied to clipboard!', 'No videos in this category.', '{\"All\":\"All\",\"Campus Life\":\"Campus Life\",\"Research\":\"Research\",\"Admissions\":\"Admissions\",\"Academics\":\"Academics\"}', '2026-07-17 16:03:10', '2026-07-18 11:20:02', 'Views', 'Bukhara State Technical University', 'Comments', 'Reply', 'Add a comment', 'Write your comment', 'Post Comment', 'Sign in to comment', 'Comments are visible to everyone. Please sign in before adding a comment or reply.', 'Sign In', 'Signed in as', 'Category', 'Duration', 'Platform', 'Local', 'YouTube', 'Playing', 'Verified channel'),
